    documentation 	
|Extends the Metric IntegrityRing with Operations to separate Integer and Fractional Part. 
|Doesn't add new capabilities. 
|The Separation is more for ordering purposes, because all the analytical Funtions are defined here. 
|Body and BodyDouble are relatively simple Classes compared to RingLong despite their hight Performance and analytical Capabilities.
    
